# Agent4Bio: 数据不属于 Agent。策展产物、备份、证据缓存、工作区留在计算节点，
# 耐久元数据的指定位置是 Genome-web design/data/analysis/<Genus_species>/expression/metadata/
# （见 tasks.yaml G3）；本仓库只管规范、脚本与小数据。
# Per-species generated data (never commit):
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/output/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/backup/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/work/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot_verify/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/*/
!20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/*/
# Any future agent's generated data:
*/output/
*/backup/
*/work/
*/pilot_verify/
*/pilot/*/
# Bytecode and caches:
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-species evidence-pull logs are run artifacts, not method:
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/*_pull.log
*/pilot/*_pull.log
# Re-include the _dispatch run record (generic rule above re-ignored it; last match wins):
!20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/

# Per-species run logs at pilot root:
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/*.log
*/pilot/*.log

# 公开仓库：数据一律不进（本地输入与运行记录）
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/data/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/review/
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/*.json
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/*.log
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/*.txt
20261123-ppgr-rnaseq-curation/pilot/_dispatch/*.md
